84387	84412	82968	82969	Mrs. Oldershaw	270	“ DEAR OLD LOVE -- Keep the seven - and - twenty shillings , and burn my other letter . I have changed my mind .
84413	84464	82968	82969	Mrs. Oldershaw	270	“ I wrote the first time after a horrible night . I write this time after a ride on horseback , a tumbler of claret , and the breast of a chicken . Is that explanation enough ? Please say Yes , for I want to go back to my piano .
84465	84623	82968	82969	Mrs. Oldershaw	270	“ No ; I ca n’t go back yet ; I must answer your question first . But are you really so very simple as to suppose that I do n’t see straight through you and your letter ? You know that the major ’s difficulty is our opportunity as well as I do ; but you want me to take the responsibility of making the first proposal , do n’t you ? Suppose I take it in your own roundabout way ? Suppose I say , ‘ Pray do n’t ask me how I propose inflaming Mr. Armadale and extinguishing Miss Milroy ; the question is so shockingly abrupt I really ca n’t answer it . Ask me , instead , if it is the modest ambition of my life to become Miss Milroy ’s governess ? ’ Yes , if you please , Mrs. Oldershaw , and if you will assist me by becoming my reference .
84624	84657	82968	82969	Mrs. Oldershaw	270	“ There it is for you ! If some serious disaster happens ( which is quite possible ) , what a comfort it will be to remember that it was all my fault !
84658	84744	82968	82969	Mrs. Oldershaw	270	“ Now I have done this for you , will you do something for me . I want to dream away the little time I am likely to have left here in my own way . Be a merciful Mother Oldershaw , and spare me the worry of looking at the Ins and Outs , and adding up the chances For and Against , in this new venture of mine . Think for me , in short , until I am obliged to think for myself .
