214540	214652	212824	212826	Miss Gwilt _	357	“ MY DEAR MR . BROCK -- I am in sad trouble . Midwinter has quarreled with me and left me ; and my lawyer has quarreled with me and left me ; and ( except dear little Miss Milroy , who has forgiven me ) all the neighbors have turned their backs on me . There is a good deal about ‘ me ’ in this , but I ca n’t help it . I am very miserable alone in my own house . Do pray come and see me ! You are the only old friend I have left , and I do long so to tell you about it .
