214735	214858	212824	212826	Miss Gwilt _	357	“ RESPECTED SIR -- I see a letter in your writing , on the table along with the others , which I am sorry to say my master is not well enough to open . He is down with a sort of low fever . The doctor says it has been brought on with worry and anxiety which master was not strong enough to bear . This seems likely ; for I was with him when he went to London last month , and what with his own business , and the business of looking after that person who afterward gave us the slip , he was worried and anxious all the time ; and for the matter of that , so was I.
