215047	215113	212824	212826	Miss Gwilt _	357	“ MISS GWILT -- The post hour has passed for three mornings following , and has brought me no answer to my letter . Are you purposely bent on insulting me ? or have you left Thorpe Ambrose ? In either case , I wo n’t put up with your conduct any longer . The law shall bring you to book , if I ca n’t .
