262144	262200	258144	258145	MISS GWILT	357	“ When it had been understood between us that Armadale was to be taken into our confidence , we began to talk about ourselves again . How the time flew ! What a sweet enchantment it was to forget everything in his arms ! How he loves me!--ah , poor fellow , how he loves me !
