327476	327704	325569	325570	the doctor	486	“ ‘ You know already , ’ I said , ‘ that my marriage has not been a happy one . Draw your own conclusions from that ; and do n’t press me to tell you whether the news of Mr. Armadale ’s rescue from the sea is , or is not , the welcome news that it ought to be to his wife ! ’ That was enough to put his withered old face in a glow , and to set his withered old hopes growing again . I had only to add , ‘ If you will do what I ask you to do , no matter how incomprehensible and how mysterious my request may seem to be ; and if you will accept my assurances that you shall run no risk yourself , and that you shall receive the proper explanations at the proper time , you will have such a claim on my gratitude and my regard as no man living has ever had yet ! ’ I had only to say those words , and to point them by a look and a stolen pressure of his hand , and I had him at my feet , blindly eager to obey me . If he could have seen what I thought of myself ; but that does n’t matter : he saw nothing .
