339362	339408	339359	339360	the doctor	486	“ Handel on Sunday evening -- and Haydn occasionally , when not too cheerful . But , as I was about to say , music is not the only entertainment offered to my nervous inmates . Amusing reading is provided for those who prefer books . ”
